<title>CHILE: Cervecerias 1996 net sharply lower.</title>
<headline>Cervecerias 1996 net sharply lower.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean brewery Compania Cervecerias Unidas SA reported the following results last year.</p>
<p>			    1996		1995</p>
<p>Net earnings	    18.17	     26.73</p>
<p>Operating profit	350.8 million    3.31</p>
<p>Non-operating profit  18.70	     24.50</p>
<p>Revenues		  57.52	     65.46</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos except where noted.</p>
<p>((-- Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211))</p>
</text>
